# Student Management System

A simple C++ based console application to manage student records.

## 📋 Features

- 🔹 Insert Student record  
- 🔹 View All Student records  
- 🔹 Search Student record by ID  
- 🔹 Search Student record by Name  
- 🔹 Delete Student record  
- 🔹 Update Student record  
- 🔹 Sort Students by Name  
- 🔹 Display Statistics (like count, average age, etc.)

## 🛠 Technologies Used

- C++
- Standard Template Library (`<vector>`, `<string>`, etc.)
- g++ compiler

